        <tr id="comment-body-449541"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL242898https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL242898at10%2FMay%2F251%3A16AM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-42898" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-42898</a> at 10/May/25 1:16 AM</h5>

<h4><a name="%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0"></a>内部环境复现</h4>

<p>参考 <a href="https://issues.redhat.com/browse/RHEL-1296" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://issues.redhat.com/browse/RHEL-1296</a> ，在内部环境使用es标准windows 2016镜像运行虚机：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>/usr/libexec/qemu-kvm \
-name guest=daketest01,debug-threads=on \
-machine pc-i440fx-rhel7.6.0,accel=kvm,usb=off,dump-guest-core=off \
-cpu Broadwell-IBRS,vme=on,ss=on,vmx=on,f16c=on,rdrand=on,hypervisor=on,arat=on,tsc-adjust=on,umip=on,stibp=on,arch-capabilities=on,xsaveopt=on,pdpe1gb=on,abm=on,skip-l1dfl-vmentry=on,pschange-mc-no=on,hv-time,hv-relaxed,hv-vapic,hv-spinlocks=0x1fff \
-m 16G \
-smp 8 \
-uuid 2b268988-1b3c-41ad-b140-961b4f364d87 \
-smbios type=1 \
-nodefaults \
-monitor stdio \
-rtc base=localtime,driftfix=slew \
-global kvm-pit.lost_tick_policy=delay \
-no-hpet \
-boot strict=on \
-device piix3-usb-uhci,id=usb,bus=pci.0,addr=0x1.0x2 \
-device qemu-xhci,id=usb1,bus=pci.0,addr=0x4 \
-device virtio-serial-pci,id=virtio-serial0,bus=pci.0,addr=0x5 \
-drive file=/root/dakeiskind/virenv/windows-2016-standard-en.qcow2,format=qcow2,if=none,id=hda,cache=none,aio=native \
-device virtio-blk-pci,scsi=off,bus=pci.0,addr=0x6,drive=hda,id=virtio-disk1,write-cache=on,bootindex=1 \
-netdev user,id=internet \
-device e1000,netdev=internet,mac=52:54:00:12:34:56 \
-device usb-tablet,id=input0,bus=usb.0,port=1 \
-device virtio-balloon-pci,id=balloon0,bus=pci.0,addr=0x8 \
-object rng-random,id=objrng0,filename=/dev/urandom \
-device virtio-rng-pci,rng=objrng0,id=rng0,bus=pci.0,addr=0x9 \
-sandbox on,obsolete=deny,elevateprivileges=deny,spawn=deny,resourcecontrol=deny \
-msg timestamp=on \
-S \
-s \
-vnc 0.0.0.0:25 -device cirrus-vga,id=video0,bus=pci.0,addr=0x7 \
-qmp tcp:localhost:42222,server,nowait</pre>
</div></div>

<p>在guest windows内搭建软件环境并构建复现代码：</p>

<div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="codeContent panelContent">
<pre class="code-c++"><span class="code-macro">#pragma comment(lib, <span class="code-quote-red">"winmm"</span>)
</span><span class="code-macro">#include <span class="code-quote-red">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>
</span><span class="code-macro">#include <span class="code-quote-red">&lt;windows.h&gt;</span>
</span>
<span class="code-macro">#define SWITCH_PEROID 13
</span>
<span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">int</span></span> main(<span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">int</span></span> argc, <span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">char</span></span>* argv[])
{
    if (argc != 2)
    { 
    	printf(<span class="code-quote-red">"parameter error!\n"</span>);
    	printf(<span class="code-quote-red">"USAGE: *.exe time(ms)\n"</span>);
    	printf(<span class="code-quote-red">"example: *.exe 40\n"</span>);
    	<span class="code-keyword">return</span> 0; 
    }
    <span class="code-keyword">else</span>
	{
		DWORD internal = atoi((<span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">char</span></span>*)argv[1]);
		DWORD count = 0;

		<span class="code-keyword">while</span> (1)
		{
			count++;
			timeBeginPeriod(1);
			DWORD start = timeGetTime();
			Sleep(internal);
			timeEndPeriod(1);

			if ((count % SWITCH_PEROID) == 0)
			{
				Sleep(1);
			}
		}
	}
	<span class="code-keyword">return</span> 0;
}</pre>
</div></div>

<p>并运行：</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/354365" alt="image-20250509-162335.png" height="26" width="599" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>在host上执行以下脚本：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>#!/usr/bin/bash

while [ 1 ];do hwclock --systohc; echo systohc; hwclock --hctosys; echo hctosys; echo ========;echo; done</pre>
</div></div>

<p>执行后几秒钟内windows虚机进程就会crash，打开coredump看到calltrace和{{lost_clock}}如下：</p>

