        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-449545"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>对应到虚机domain xml，需要增加：</p>

<div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="codeContent panelContent">
<pre class="code-xml"><span class="code-tag">&lt;domain type=<span class="code-quote">'kvm'</span>&gt;</span>
......
  <span class="code-tag">&lt;features&gt;</span>
    <span class="code-tag">&lt;acpi/&gt;</span>
    <span class="code-tag">&lt;apic/&gt;</span>
    <span class="code-tag">&lt;hyperv&gt;</span>
      <span class="code-tag">&lt;relaxed state=<span class="code-quote">'on'</span>/&gt;</span>
      <span class="code-tag">&lt;vapic state=<span class="code-quote">'on'</span>/&gt;</span>
      <span class="code-tag">&lt;spinlocks state=<span class="code-quote">'on'</span> retries=<span class="code-quote">'8191'</span>/&gt;</span>
+     <span class="code-tag">&lt;synic state=<span class="code-quote">'on'</span>/&gt;</span>
+     <span class="code-tag">&lt;stimer state=<span class="code-quote">'on'</span>&gt;</span>
+       <span class="code-tag">&lt;direct state=<span class="code-quote">'on'</span>/&gt;</span>
+     <span class="code-tag">&lt;/stimer&gt;</span>
    <span class="code-tag">&lt;/hyperv&gt;</span>
  <span class="code-tag">&lt;/features&gt;</span>
......</pre>
</div></div>



<p><a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A29953ef2-fede-4d69-9248-491afae9de72" class="user-hover" rel="557058:29953ef2-fede-4d69-9248-491afae9de72" data-account-id="557058:29953ef2-fede-4d69-9248-491afae9de72" accountid="557058:29953ef2-fede-4d69-9248-491afae9de72" rel="noreferrer">郇宏达</a>  请问之前咱们遇到过这个问题吗？是否需要对应到EAS？另外，客户目前因此问题已经多次影响了业务，急需应对方法，麻烦帮忙判断是否有可以通过nova来进行对应调整？</p>
        </td></tr>
